From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:38:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Build libandroid, libandroid_runtime and libjnigraphics for
 x86_64 guests

The identity engine runs x86_64 guests on an x86_64 host, so the
NativeBridge guest needs x86_64 builds of the NDK libraries the test
apps link: libandroid and libjnigraphics, and the libandroid_runtime
they depend on. Their stub lists are LP64 and arch-neutral
(stubs_arm64.cc equals stubs_riscv64.cc), so the x86_64 build takes
the arm64 list, as 0004 does for the GL proxies.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Patch-Reason: the x86_64 arch blocks live inside these Android.bp modules, which no launcher, loader or environment setting can add; the stub list is shared by every LP64 arch here
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 android_api/libandroid/Android.bp         | 3 +++
 android_api/libandroid_runtime/Android.bp | 3 +++
 android_api/libjnigraphics/Android.bp     | 3 +++
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/android_api/libandroid/Android.bp b/android_api/libandroid/Android.bp
index 600161c99f39991039ffb09e97cc1c3ac38d0a50..31745f672bae1b85fe5330a680cf2d2e880312d1 100644
--- a/android_api/libandroid/Android.bp
+++ b/android_api/libandroid/Android.bp
@@ -30,6 +30,9 @@ cc_library {
         arm64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
         },
+        x86_64: {
+            srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
+        },
         riscv64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_riscv64.cc"],
         },
diff --git a/android_api/libandroid_runtime/Android.bp b/android_api/libandroid_runtime/Android.bp
index c87a397c803a1c305159c13b7a1788726c4d46b7..6890fbfa938e7c1dbd2884d67ce1c2bafed46514 100644
--- a/android_api/libandroid_runtime/Android.bp
+++ b/android_api/libandroid_runtime/Android.bp
@@ -30,6 +30,9 @@ cc_library {
         arm64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
         },
+        x86_64: {
+            srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
+        },
         riscv64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_riscv64.cc"],
         },
diff --git a/android_api/libjnigraphics/Android.bp b/android_api/libjnigraphics/Android.bp
index 5e21123077becc02c0be64cfaa4f1115bc30d029..6dc050a7eb6b86b0e8fb18e43c489a80a7b4fa81 100644
--- a/android_api/libjnigraphics/Android.bp
+++ b/android_api/libjnigraphics/Android.bp
@@ -30,6 +30,9 @@ cc_library {
         arm64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
         },
+        x86_64: {
+            srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
+        },
         riscv64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_riscv64.cc"],
         },
